From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cataclysm-ios <cataclysm-ios@localhost>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:15:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Use iOS-compatible SDL render drivers

The desktop renderer hint requests OpenGL, but SDL 3.4 exposes OpenGL ES as
`opengles2` on iOS. If the GPU renderer is unavailable, try Metal and OpenGL
ES before Cataclysm falls back to the unsupported window-surface renderer.

---
 src/sdltiles.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/sdltiles.cpp b/src/sdltiles.cpp
--- a/src/sdltiles.cpp
+++ b/src/sdltiles.cpp
@@ -843,3 +843,7 @@ static void WinCreate()
 #  else
+#    if defined(CATA_IOS)
+    SDL_SetHint( SDL_HINT_RENDER_DRIVER, "gpu,metal,opengles2" );
+#    else
     SDL_SetHint( SDL_HINT_RENDER_DRIVER, "gpu,opengl" );
+#    endif
 #  endif
